Lamplit third-party attribution index

The complete human-readable third-party notices for this distribution are in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Lamplit releases keep that file, the licenses/
directory, and sbom/lamplit.spdx.json together. In particular, upstream
Hindsight 0.9.2 remains MIT-licensed and @lamplitisles/dsh-hindsight 0.1.1
remains Apache-2.0-licensed; their full license texts are preserved under
licenses/. The independently versioned Hindsight ONNX image is built by this
repository and carries its own model and Python dependency notices. The
PostgreSQL service image remains an external artifact. Their publisher-side
inventory is under docs/service-image-license-inventory.md.
